{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781475483576,"sessionID":"ses_137c983adffeBso7aU5zHS2IEF","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_PiRdOohmpDeLOcwLY303Zjek","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Community Workshop Room Replan\n2: \n3: You are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n4: \n5: Read the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n6: \n7: Work in two stages:\n8: \n9: 1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n10: 2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n11: \n12: The top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.\n\n(End of file - total 12 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","text":"# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"totalLines":12,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","time":{"start":1781475483563,"end":1781475483574}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0bc7b4622234261e016a2f289b9ea4819183bc925ed4bfb1ab"}},"id":"prt_ec8369fa8001rYgKuR6m0bLMFQ","sessionID":"ses_137c983adffeBso7aU5zHS2IEF","messageID":"msg_ec8369261001g0nyRX82GCK40x"}}
